SUMMARY:Music Bingo @ Ponysaurus Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLet's hit Ponysaurus Brewing for som
 e midweek music bingo\, my second favorite music bingo spot in Durham\, I'
 m open to suggestions for any other spots if ya know em. It's a good way t
 o break up the week too.\n\nThings get started at 7pm typically\, so I'd s
 ay get there a little earlier to get some parking and enjoy their selectio
 n of beers and pizza!\n\nWinter time tends to be a bit emptier and the sum
 mer time can get packed so be ready for that! All are welcome. Hope to see
  you there!
