SUMMARY:World Cup Watch Party :   USA vs Paraguay 
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nWhether you're a fan of the "Red\, W
 hite\, and Blue"\, a supporter of "La Albirroja"\, or just enjoy watching 
 the "beautiful game" join us for the opening match of the 2026 FIFA World 
 Cup. Bull McCabe's is one of my favorite places to watch soccer games in t
 he area and they do a great job of hosting watch parties. Even if you're n
 ot a sports fan\, the energy at these events with suck you in.\n\nWe'll be
  there about an hour before the game starts to allow folks to chat and get
  settled before things kickoff (9pm EST).\n\nI'm also going to give away a
  trivia prize for the first attendee who can answer the following question
  correctly in person. Keep in mind that you are not allowed to use your ph
 one while giving me the answer.\n\n\\*\\*Trivia Question: Which players sc
 ored the fastest US goals in World Cup history for the men's and women's t
 eam?
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31501
 0538/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260529T135250Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260529T135250Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
